BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:159982@iso-ne.com
DTSTAMP:20260613T092153Z
DTSTART:20260602T160000Z
DTEND:20260602T193000Z
SUMMARY:Consumer Liaison Group Meeting
LOCATION:Coburn Hall @ UMass Lowell (850 Broadway Street\, Lowell\, MA 01854)
DESCRIPTION:Stakeholder forum between ISO New England and regional consumer organizations and advocates to exchange information about the economic impacts of New England’s bulk power system and wholesale electricity markets.\n\nThis meeting will be held both in-person and virtually.\n\nRegister to attend this meeting in-person.\n\nTo attend the meeting virtually\, please add the meeting details to your calendar\, or join from the link below at 12:30 p.m. on June 2. More meeting details can also be found on the event website.\n\nAdd to My Calendar\n\nWebEx link: https://iso-newengland.webex.com/iso-newengland/j.php?MTID=m2efc541e7d6425fe276ba5625d2df133\n\nPassword: CLG26!June\n\nTeleconference Info: 1-650-479-3208 / Access Code: 2430 969 9462 / Password: 25426058\nhttps://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=159982
URL:https://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=159982
END:VEVENT
